            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A transmission assembly (3‴‴ʺ) for an aircraft (1‴‴ʺ), comprising a member to be lubricated (1800; 1801; 1400; 1401) for transmission of the motion; a tank (2500) for a lubricating fluid and passive retaining means (2600) adapted to prevent, in use, outflow of the lubricating fluid from the tank (2500) when the temperature of the member to be lubricated (1800; 1801; 1400; 1401) is below a threshold value and to allow, in use, outflow of the lubricating fluid from the tank (2500) towards said member to be lubricated (1800; 1801; 1400; 1401), when the temperature of the member to be lubricated (1800; 1801; 1400; 1401) is higher than or equal to the threshold value.</p>
